20-                                            Abstract
21-
22-                                            We derive explicit formulas for the Reshetikhin–Turaev invariants of all oriented
23-                                            Seifert manifolds associated to an arbitrary complex finite dimensional simple
24-                                            Lie algebra g in terms of the Seifert invariants and standard data for g. A
25-                                            main corollary is a determination of the full asymptotic expansions of these
26:                                            invariants for lens spaces in the limit of large quantum level. Our results are
27-                                            in agreement with the asymptotic expansion conjecture due to J. E. Andersen
28-                                            [1], [2].
29-
30-                                            AMS Classification numbers Primary: 57M27
31-                                            Secondary: 17B37, 18D10, 41A60
32-
33-                                            Keywords: Quantum invariants, Seifert manifolds, quantum groups, modu-
34-                                            lar tensor categories, asymptotic expansions
35-
36-
